  "questionnaireHit6Intro": "Think about the last four weeks and pick the answer that fits best for each question.",
  "questionnaireHit6Q1": "When you have headaches, how often is the pain severe?",
  "questionnaireHit6Q2": "How often do headaches limit your ability to do usual daily activities, including household work, work, school or social activities?",
